        pages: [
          {
            title: 'Asserufen Schafkopf',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Asserufen Schafkopf (Ace-calling Schafkopf) is a four-player variant of PfÃ¤lzer Schafkopf. The game announcer calls an ace of a suit to choose a partner; the holder of that ace is the teammate but stays hidden until playing the called ace. In calling games hearts (Herz) is trump. Uses French-suited cards. Caller leads; when the called suit is led, the holder must play the called ace if possible (Unten Raus). Solo options also exist.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Pfälzer Schafkopf variant; Asserufen = call the ace (Ass). Hearts trump in calling games; French-suited; Palatinate rules.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
