                text: '32 cards French-suited (Schafkopf pack). Hearts trump in calling games.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '32-card French pack; score sheet.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Standard Schafkopf deal; caller announces game and calls an ace.',
              },
